   "source": [
    "提供具体差异路径的语义文档，判断这些路径差异的语义触发了哪些条例维度"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c6a6d0f0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "遍历目录dataset4geodiff\\experiment_results\\experiments\\2024-Nov\\results\\final\\callpath-rq12-patterns\\USA-Others-androzoo-all下的一级目录，这个目录是以apkname为名的文件夹，然后打开该文件夹会有一个txt文档，里面记录了该apk不同版本的路径差异语义文档，加载该文档。\n",
    "\n",
    "这是条例的json文档dataset4clauses\\assessment_code_prompts\\clause_prompts_lines.jsonl，加载该文档。\n",
    "\n",
    "然后粗分类：有5个大类，[p, CR, R, E, O]，先对该路径差异语义文档判断一下看该路径差异语义文档很大概率是哪几类，绝对不是哪几类，然后再对路径差异语义文档进行对该桶的细分，\n",
    "Return JSON with exactly these top-level fields:\n",
    "{\n",
    "  \"likely\": [\"P\"|\"CR\"|\"C\"|\"R\"|\"E\"|\"O\", ...],\n",
    "  \"unlikely\": [...],\n",
    "  \"unsure\": [...],\n",
    "  \"reason\": \"...\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "细分类：遍历该桶的clauses的prompt，比如上一步判断该路径差异语义文档属于P类，那就挑P开头的prompt，再遍历所有的txt，批量openai api查询，然后批量处理保存结果。\n",
    "Return JSON with exactly these top-level fields:\n",
    "{\n",
    "  \"apkname\": string,\n",
    "  {\n",
    "    \"semantic_diff\": \"xx\",\n",
    "    \"candidate_clauses\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "          \"Clause_id\": string,\n",
    "          \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\",\n",
    "          \"score\": number,\n",
    "          \"why\": string\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "          \"Clause_id\": string,\n",
    "          \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\",\n",
    "          \"score\": number,\n",
    "          \"why\": string\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        ...\n",
    "      ],\n",
    "  }\n",
    "}\n",
    "if don't find any trigered clause, return candidate_clauses.Clause_id as null."
   ]
  },
